        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;What is not drawn&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Distributed tables, dictionaries and more than one shard are not deployed (chapter 07 treats them as reference). The pod also listens on MySQL :9004 and PostgreSQL :9005 because the image enables them by default, but no Service port exposes them and no client uses them; gRPC and HTTPS are off. No backup mechanism is deployed. The materialized view writes the rows it derives back into otel_traces_trace_id_ts; merges and TTL moves run on the background pools, never on the query thread." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1">
